name etoolbox-generic
category Package
revision 68513
shortdesc A loader for etoolbox.sty in non-LaTeX formats
longdesc This package implements a wrapper which allows the user to load
longdesc the LaTeX-independent part of LaTeX package etoolbox in other
longdesc formats. It was implemented as an auxiliary package of Memoize.
